; Export list for VkLayer_feed_vk.
;
; The manifest names exactly one entry point, vkNegotiateLoaderLayerInterfaceVersion,
; and the loader looks it up by that undecorated name. On x86 VKAPI_CALL is __stdcall,
; so a bare /EXPORT: (or __declspec(dllexport)) would emit the decorated _name@4 and
; the loader's GetProcAddress would miss it. A .def exports the plain name on both
; architectures, so the same file is used for x64 and x86 and there is no arch-specific
; export rule to get wrong.
EXPORTS
    vkNegotiateLoaderLayerInterfaceVersion
